{"content_hash": "9c979ef51f871bd2", "version_id": 543, "article_id": 55, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Solanke scores late as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd", "title_zh": "索兰克补时进球，十人热刺客场逼平曼联", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/football/videos/crz9zdl0g04zo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590701722867-95e186ddbc24?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8c29sYW5rZSUyMHNjb3JlcyUyMGFkZGVkfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE2NzgxMzh8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Weigler Godoy on Unsplash", "author": "Weigler Godoy", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@weigler?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-group-of-soccer-players-playing-a-game-of-soccer-JvccQap9IxQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(326, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(4, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "6686c357331f"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-10", "word_count": 141, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 at Old Trafford on Saturday. Spurs played with only ten men, but Dominic Solanke scored in stoppage time to save a point.", "lead_zh": "周六在老特拉福德，曼联与托特纳姆热刺1比1战平。热刺少一人作战，但多米尼克·索兰克在补时阶段进球，为球队抢回一分。", "preview": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 at Old Trafford in a feisty Premier League match. Although United had more chances, they co", "preview_zh": "在英超一场火药味十足的比赛中，曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德1比1握手言和。虽然曼联机会更多，却未能打进第二球。主场球迷很不满，因为球队在争四的关键时刻丢掉了两分。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 532, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/55/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 51.675, "size_bytes": 313776, "engine": "edge-tts", "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural", "word_count": 161, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@fc48a26/content/data/versions/543.json", "paragraphs": ["Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 at Old Trafford in a feisty Premier League match. Although United had more chances, they could not score a second goal. The home fans were unhappy because their team dropped two important points in the race for the top four.", "Tottenham played with ten men after a red card, so they had to defend for much of the game. However, they stayed calm and waited for a chance to attack. In added time, Dominic Solanke scored to make it 1-1. The away fans celebrated because their team never gave up.", "This result means both teams continue to fight for a place in next season's Champions League. United will feel disappointed, while Spurs will be happy with a hard-earned point. If United want to finish higher, they must learn to win these kinds of games."], "paragraphs_zh": ["在英超一场火药味十足的比赛中，曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德1比1握手言和。虽然曼联机会更多，却未能打进第二球。主场球迷很不满，因为球队在争四的关键时刻丢掉了两分。", "热刺在吃到红牌后十人应战，因此大部分时间只能防守。不过他们保持冷静，等待反击机会。补时阶段，多米尼克·索兰克破门，将比分扳成1比1。客队球迷欢呼庆祝，因为球队始终没有放弃。", "这个结果意味着两队还要继续争夺下赛季欧冠资格。曼联会感到失望，而热刺则会对这来之不易的一分感到满意。如果曼联想要排名更高，就必须学会赢下这类比赛。"], "body": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 at Old Trafford in a feisty Premier League match. Although United had more chances, they could not score a second goal. The home fans were unhappy because their team dropped two important points in the race for the top four.\n\nTottenham played with ten men after a red card, so they had to defend for much of the game. However, they stayed calm and waited for a chance to attack. In added time, Dominic Solanke scored to make it 1-1. The away fans celebrated because their team never gave up.\n\nThis result means both teams continue to fight for a place in next season's Champions League. United will feel disappointed, while Spurs will be happy with a hard-earned point. If United want to finish higher, they must learn to win these kinds of games.", "body_zh": "在英超一场火药味十足的比赛中，曼联与托特纳姆热刺在老特拉福德1比1握手言和。虽然曼联机会更多，却未能打进第二球。主场球迷很不满，因为球队在争四的关键时刻丢掉了两分。\n\n热刺在吃到红牌后十人应战，因此大部分时间只能防守。不过他们保持冷静，等待反击机会。补时阶段，多米尼克·索兰克破门，将比分扳成1比1。客队球迷欢呼庆祝，因为球队始终没有放弃。\n\n这个结果意味着两队还要继续争夺下赛季欧冠资格。曼联会感到失望，而热刺则会对这来之不易的一分感到满意。如果曼联想要排名更高，就必须学会赢下这类比赛。", "text": "Manchester United and Tottenham Hotspur drew 1-1 at Old Trafford in a feisty Premier League match. Although United had more chances, they could not score a second goal. The home fans were unhappy because their team dropped two important points in the race for the top four. Tottenham played with ten men after a red card, so they had to defend for much of the game. However, they stayed calm and waited for a chance to attack. In added time, Dominic Solanke scored to make it 1-1. The away fans celebrated because their team never gave up. This result means both teams continue to fight for a place in next season's Champions League. United will feel disappointed, while Spurs will be happy with a hard-earned point. If United want to finish higher, they must learn to win these kinds of games.", "vocab": [{"word": "draw", "pos": "verb", "zh": "打平，战平", "note": "体育新闻常用，名词也是 draw（平局）", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "added time", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "补时", "note": "也叫 stoppage time 或 injury time", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "feisty", "pos": "adj", "zh": "火药味十足的，激烈的", "note": "形容比赛对抗激烈", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "salvage", "pos": "verb", "zh": "挽救，抢回", "note": "salvage a point 意思是抢回一分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "red card", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "红牌", "note": "球员被罚下，球队少一人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "defend", "pos": "verb", "zh": "防守", "note": "反义词是 attack（进攻）", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "give up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "放弃", "note": "常见短语动词，never give up 永不放弃", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "disappointed", "pos": "adj", "zh": "失望的", "note": "feel disappointed 感到失望", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hard-earned", "pos": "adj", "zh": "来之不易的", "note": "常修饰 point、win 等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "Champions League", "pos": "noun", "zh": "欧洲冠军联赛", "note": "欧洲顶级俱乐部赛事", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd", "summary_original": "Dominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw against Manchester United in a feisty encounter at Old Trafford.", "body_original": "Solanke scores in added time as 10-man Spurs draw with Man Utd\nThis content is not available in your location.\nThere was an error\nDominic Solanke scores in stoppage time to salvage a point for 10-man Tottenham as they snatch a draw against Manchester United in a feisty encounter at Old Trafford.\nMATCH REPORT:\nPremier League - Manchester United 1-1 Tottenham Hotspur\nAvailable to UK users only.\nSubsection\nPremier League\nPublished\n4 hours ago\nShare\nclose panel\nShare page\nCopy link\nAbout sharing\nRelated topics\nTottenham Hotspur\nFollow\nTottenham Hotspur\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nTottenham Hotspur\nUpdates from your Sport topics will appear in\nMy Sport\nand in a collection on the\nSport homepage\n.\nManchester United\nFollow\nManchester United\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nManchester United\nUpdates from your Sport topics will appear in\nMy Sport\nand in a collection on the\nSport homepage\n.\nFootball\nFollow\nFootball\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nFootball\nUpdates from your Sport topics will appear in\nMy Sport\nand in a collection on the\nSport homepage\n.\nPremier League\nFollow\nPremier League\nclose panel\nYou are now following\nPremier League\nUpdates from your Sport topics will appear in\nMy Sport\nand in a collection on the\nSport homepage\n.\nRead description", "fetched_at": "2026-10-11T00:22:17.395512", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Manchester", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.8, "sm": 100, "em": 799, "cs": 0, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "United", "s": 0.812, "e